                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The sovereign guard makes a halberd Strike and compares the attack roll result to the AC of up to two foes, each of whom must be within the guard's reach. The guard rolls damage only once and applies it to each creature hit. The guard's multiple attack penalty doesn't increase until they have made both Strikes.</p>"
